  "observations": [
    "Authored reusable Link redirects as preview; message materialization creates personalized ShortLink/session before click. Real link click redirects before asynchronous click recording; bot detection also occurs in worker.",
    "Generated UTM merge replaces existing generated UTM keys; campaign/journey utm_token and playbook.code are not universally public API IDs. Fragment retained; avoid duplicate hello_session destinations.",
    "Published async initialize does not automatically track page.viewed. Query session > config > cookie, optional generation; cookie/ack attempts do not prove processed server state. Track returns SDK Response failed/succeeded/json.",
    "Site calls explicitly once/view with SPA current URL; product/cart calls and trusted backend records must avoid duplicates and preserve correctly associated business/profile/session and original time.",
    "Total link clicks include repeats; unique message-click counts are not distinct people. Delivered same-business/customer source and original click/purchase chronology/windows determine attribution, not URL/UTM alone.",
    "Approved unsaved Message/SMS editor is useful for locating the shared toolbar control. Literal URL is not a created shortlink; no fake result or new capture needed."
  ]
